{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_37E2E0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake。\n谢谢你把我分到研发班。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":43,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"马上进入正题吧，我已经开始开发双足步行兵器了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":70,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不过，这里也不能随意使用物资。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":46,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"嗯。抱歉，我们毕竟不是正规军。\n没有税收，也没有国防预算。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":86,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"我知道。所以有件事想拜托你……，\n以后如果再和AI兵器交战，\n能不能把它们的零件收集回来？\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":128,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"把那些零件拿来利用，\n开发应该就能更高效地推进。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"说起来容易……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":25,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"Boss，你能做到。\n毕竟连那台Pupa都被你瘫痪了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":64,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"也对。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":10,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"当然，如果你对双足步行兵器没兴趣，\n这边也可以慢慢来……。\n我不会强迫你。毕竟这里的Boss是你。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":136,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"知道了。\n我不能保证，不过会考虑的。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":53,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"另外，每台AI兵器都有\n作为武装核心的“头部部件”。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":73,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"只要回收头部部件，就能使用\n与各个头部部件对应的武器。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"……不过，我想AI兵器对你来说也是强敌。\n千万别勉强自己。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"放心。我没打算白白送命。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":37,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"一定要小心。\n……另外，这次开始开发的双足步行兵器，\n我觉得它需要一个名字。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"是啊。\n总不能每次都叫“那台双足步行兵器”，太麻烦了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"所以，我和Miller商量了一下，\n叫“Metal Gear<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>”……怎么样？\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"Metal Gear……<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"嗯。“Metal Gear”是从你说过的\nGranin那句话里取来的。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"<R=『ZEKE』,ZEKE>是什么意思？\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=『ZEKE』,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":38,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"这是二战期间美军给日本军机起的代号。\n<R=零式,ZEKE>拥有出色的空战性能，是日本海军的\n主力战机。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=零式,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":135,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"所以，\n名字就叫“Metal Gear<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>”，怎么样？\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":67,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"嗯。没意见。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":19,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"Miller也说过，<R=『无国界之师』,MSF>\n需要足以遏制他国干涉的力量吧。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=『无国界之师』,MSF>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":94,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"如果拥有Metal Gear这种“威慑力”，\nMSF应该就能获得真正意义上的自由。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"但愿如此……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":22,"review_flag":""}]}